OL,3,AMan and daughter who dumped body in
OL,4,Acanal jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and his daughter who disposed of
OL,7,Fa woman's body in a canal, after she
OL,8,Fwas murdered in a "brutal" attack by
OL,9,Fthe father, have been jailed.
OL,11,FChereiss Bailey was found dead near a
OL,12,Fwaterway off Ryders Green Road in West
OL,13,FBromwich, West Midlands, in October
OL,14,Flast year.
OL,16,FJohn Anslow, 65, assaulted the
OL,17,F36-year-old victim at his home before
OL,18,Fhe and Hayley-Marie Ferguson, 42, moved
OL,19,Fher body in a wheelchair and used a
OL,20,Fwashing line with paving slabs attached
OL,21,Fto submerge it in the water.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
